{"id":"vod_bf_41561","vodId":"41561","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"亚人第一季","name_cn":"亚人第一季","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-42/9bff63521ba5c814173cb3995c72fc35.jpg"},"summary":"在这个世界上，存在着能够永生不死的人类，即使遭到致命的重创，也会在短时间内迅速恢复，人们称之为“亚人”。永井圭（宫野真守 配音）是一名平凡的高中生，某日，一场车祸让他亚人的身份曝光，随即遭到了有关政府部门的高价通缉，在曾经的好友海斗（细谷佳正 配音）的帮助下，永井圭踏上了永无止境的逃亡之路。　　途中，永井圭结识了同为亚人的佐藤（大冢芳忠 配音），佐藤想将永井圭纳入自己暗中组建的亚人团体之中，敏感的永井圭却发现了佐藤隐藏极深的真实面目和目的。亚人一直遭到政府的迫害和残酷研究，因此佐藤企图通过一系列恐怖袭击活动来夺回属于亚人的权利，永井圭则投靠了亚人管理委员会的户崎（樱井孝宏 配音），在他的带领下对抗强大的佐藤。在亚人和人类之间，一场充满了硝烟和鲜血的战争即将拉开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:57:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/yarendiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/yarendiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/yarendiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241031oKTRlYKlindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241031YlCAUFGYindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/yarendiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241031Sus22gyAindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/yarendiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241031dFiv5j1pindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241031sZTIRkNJindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241031Avcc5sGzindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replace